'''Metal Doge''' (メタルわんこ, ''Metaru Wanko'', '''Metal Doggy''') is a [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] variant of [[Doge]] that appears in [[Legend Stages]], [[Into the Future]], [[Cats of the Cosmos]], and [[The Aku Realms]]. He was added in [[Version 3.4 Update|Version 3.4]].

