==Enemy==
This enemy has high DPS and rapid area attacks. He has 30 HP at 100% strength magnification, but only takes one damage from non-[[Critical Hit|Critical]] attacks like all other Metal enemies. He is more of a nuisance alone, but beware, for he is spammed in nearly all his appearences.

==Strategy==
[[Catornado (Super Rare Cat)|Hurricat]] can be very useful against this enemy due to his rapid area attacks, either ending them with a critical hit or tearing them down rapidly over time. Alternatively, stacked [[Jurassic Cat (Rare Cat)|Jurassic Cat Sitters]] and [[Talents|Talented]] [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cats]] can both perform a similar feat to Hurricat, albeit not as effectively as him. You can also use [[Million-Dollar Cat (Special Cat)|Hundred-Million-Dollar Cat]] to kill Metal Doges as, with their guaranteed Critical Hits, they can get Extra Money from defeating them, but do be aware of their slow attack rate when against Metal Doge spam.

